OL,3,GNEWSAHot weather may be impacting
OL,4,Amantis numbers
OL,5,
OL,6,FRecent hot weather may be having an
OL,7,Fimpact on European mantis numbers in
OL,8,Fthe island, experts have said.
OL,10,FThe European mantis can be found across
OL,11,Fcentral Europe with Jersey at the
OL,12,Fnorthern edge of its range.
OL,14,FScientists have predicted more could be
OL,15,Fseen in the British Isles in the face
OL,16,Fof climate change, with a rise in
OL,17,Fsightings in recent years.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
