OL,3,GNEWSAHot weather may be impacting
OL,4,Amantis numbers
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the Jersey Biodiversity
OL,7,FCentre, the "unprecedented heatwaves"
OL,8,Fmay have "accelerated this expansion
OL,9,Fwith more individuals coming over from
OL,10,FFrance", but they said "more
OL,11,Finformation is needed to draw concrete
OL,12,Fconclusions".
